WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.535
NOW INTO CNN FROM THE WHITE
HOUSE, NEW SANCTIONS ANNOUNCING

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:08.241
IN RESPONSE TO THIS MOVE BY
RUSSIA.

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:11.177
CNN WHITE HOUSE CORRESPONDENT
JEREMY DIAMOND JOINING US NOW.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:15.548
WALK US THROUGH THE STEPS AND
WHAT THIS MEANS EXACTLY.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.284
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE WHITE HOUSE
PLEDGED A SWIFT AND SEVERE

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:21.521
RESPONSE TO THE ANNEXATION BY
THE RUSSIAN PRUZ AND THAT IS

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.958
WHAT WE'RE SEEING NOW.
THE UNITED STATES REJECTING THIS

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.594
ANNEXATION MOVE BY THE RUSSIAN
PRESIDENT AND ISSUING A SERIES

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:32.799
OF SEVERE SANCTIONS AGAINST
RUSSIAN OFFICIALS, THEIR FAMILY

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:35.368
MEMBERS AND ALSO TARGETING
CRUCIALLY RUSSIA'S DEFENSE

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.237
SECTOR.
AND PROVIDERS OF WEAPONRY AND

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:41.941
OTHER SUPPLIES TO THIS DEFENSE
SECTOR THAT ARE BASED IN OTHER

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.377
COUNTRIES.
A LIST OF THEM GOES FROM

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:47.814
BEGINNING WITH THE TREASURY
DEPARTMENT SANCTIONING THE HEAD

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:52.018
OF RUSSIA CENTRAL BANK, THE
TREASURY AND STATE DEPARTMENT

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:57.257
ARE ALSO SANCTIONING RELATIVES
OF MEMBERS OF RUSSIA'S NATIONAL

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:58.725
SECURITY COUNCIL, INCLUDING THE
WIFE OF RUSSIA'S PRIME MINISTER

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:05.932
AND HIS TWO ADULT CHILDREN.
THERE ARE VISA RESTRICTIONS ON

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:11.938
MONGUSH, ACCUSED TORTURING
UKRAINIAN PRISONERS OF WAR.

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:13.606
14 INTERNATIONAL SUPPLIERS
MILITARY HARDWARE ARE BEING

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:17.243
SANCTIONED HERE AND ALSO THE
DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE ADDING 57

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.480
NEW ENTITIES TO ITS LIST FOR
EXPORT CONTROLS.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.385
WE'VE ALSO JUST GOTTEN A
STATEMENT FROM PRESIDENT BIDEN

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:29.522
WHO CONDEMNS RUSSIA'S FRAUDULENT
ATTEMPT TO ANNEX SOVEREIGN

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.625
TERRITORY AND THIS IS A
VIOLATION OF INTERNATIONAL LAW,

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:37.830
TRAMPLING ON THE UNITED NATIONS
CHARTER AND SHOWS CONTEMPT FOR

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.033
PEACEFUL NATIONS EVERYWHERE.
AND THIS IS A CRUCIAL LINE FROM

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:43.870
HIS STATEMENT WHERE HE SAID,
MAKE NO MISTAKE, THESE ACTIONS

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:49.609
HAVE NO LEGITIMACY AND SAID THAT
THE U.S. WILL HONOR UKRAINE'S

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:52.078
INTERNATIONALLY RECOGNIZED
BORDERS AND PLEDGES TO CONTINUE

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:55.181
TO SUPPORT AND ARMING UKRAINIAN
MILITARY.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:58.585
ALL OF THIS IS NOTABLE BECAUSE
PRESIDENT PUTIN IS DRAWING A

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:02.956
HARDER LINE AND RAISING THE
SPECTER OF COURSE OF THE

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.992
POTENTIAL USE OF NUCLEAR
WEAPONS.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:09.195
WE HEARD HIM TODAY SAYING RUSSIA
WILL DEPEND AT ALL COSTS TIS

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:13.099
TERRITORY WHICH HE BELIEVES NOW
INCLUDED THESE FOUR UKRAINE

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:17.403
REGIONS WHICH HE IS ANNEXING AND
HE SAID THAT IT IS NOT A BLUFF,

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:21.241
THAT HE WILL DEFEND RUSSIAN
TERRITORY AT ALL COST USING ALL

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.710
MEANS.
THIS IS HEIGHTENING THE TENSIONS

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:29.515
IN THE REGION AND WE ARE SEEING
OF COURSE A STRONG U.S. RESPONSE

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:31.751
TO THESE MOVES.
&gt;&gt;&gt; LET'S GO TO WASHINGTON RIGHT

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:37.490
NOW, AND SECRETARY ANTONY
BLINKEN IS TALKING ABOUT PARTS

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:47.467
OF ANNEXATION OF UKRAINE.
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE PARTS OF

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:52.071
INCORPORATION INTO RUSSIA.
AS I SAID LAST WEEK AT THE

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:59.779
UNITED STATES SECURITY COUNCIL,
THIS TERRITORY IS AND WILL

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:02.548
REREM
REMAIN UKRAINIAN AND THEY HAVE

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:06.486
EVERY RIGHT TO TAKE BACK THIS
TERRITORY THAT RUSSIA HAS SEIZED

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:09.689
FROM IT.
CANADA AND THE UNITED STATES AND

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:12.492
LIKE SO MANY NATIONS AROUND THE
WORLD SEE EYE TO EYE ON THIS,

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:16.629
AND THESE ARE THE LATEST IN THE
LONG LINE OF ACTIONS BY RUSSIA

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:20.967
SINCE IT LAUNCHED THE WAR OF
AGGRESSION AGAINST UKRAINE THAT

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:24.937
VIOLATE THE NATIONAL LAW AND
VIOLATE THE PRINCIPLES OF

00:03:24.937 --> 00:03:27.740
SOVEREIGNTY WHICH UNDERPIN THE
INTERNATIONAL ORDER SO NECESSARY

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.711
OF KEEPING PEACE AND SECURITY
AROUND THE WORLD, AND ALL OF

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:37.183
THIS SHOWS THE KREMLIN'S UTTER
CONTEMPT FOR THE RIGHTS AND WILL

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:39.052
OF THE WILL OF THE UKRAINIAN
PEOPLE.

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:43.923
I ALSO MADE CLEAR THAT WHEN
RUSSIA MADE THIS MOVE, THE

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:52.198
UNITED STATES AND OUR ALLIES AND
PARTNERS WOULD IMPOSE SEVERE AND

00:03:52.198 --> 00:04:00.306
SWIFT CAUSE FOR THOSE WHO TRIED
TO CHANGE THE STATUS OF THE

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:04.176
UKRAINIAN PEOPLE, AND WE HAVE
DONE THAT AND THE EUROPEAN UNION

00:04:04.176 --> 00:04:10.149
AND CANADA AND U.K. ARE DOING
THE SAME.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:13.986
AND WE WILL HOLD TO ACCOUNT ANY
INDIVIDUAL, ENTITY OR COUNTRY

00:04:13.986 --> 00:04:18.157
THAT PROVIDES POLITICAL OR
ECONOMIC SUPPORT FOR PRESIDENT

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:23.730
PUTIN'S ILLEGAL ATTEMPTS TO
CHANGE THE STAT STUS OF THE

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:27.433
UKRAINIAN PEOPLE, AND THE
DEPARTMENT OF SECRETARY AND

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:29.902
DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE WILL
IMPOSE HIGH SANCTIONS IS FOR

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:33.005
THOSE ENTITIES AND INDIVIDUALS
INSIDE AND OUTSIDE OF RUSSIA

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:40.580
THAT SUPPORT IN ANY WAY THE SHAM
REFERENDA AND PURPORTED

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:47.220
ANNEXATION AND PARTS OF
ANNEXATION.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:52.458
WE WILL TAKE ACTION OF THOSE
SHAM ANNEXATION, AND IF RUSSIA

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:57.997
BLOCKS THE SECURITY COUNCIL FROM
BLOCKING SUPPORTED SANCTION, WE

00:04:57.997 --> 00:05:04.404
WILL ASK THE U.N. WHERE EVERY
NATION WILL HAVE A VOTE TO

00:05:04.404 --> 00:05:07.240
ENFORCE THAT VOTE.
EVERY COUNTRY HAS A STAKE IN

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:12.578
THOSE STEPS.
AS THE SECRETARY GUTERRES SAID

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:17.583
THIS WEEK, THE CHART SER CLEAR,
ANY ANNEXATION OF THE STATE'S

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:24.157
TERRITORY BY ANOTHER STATE BY
THE THREAT OR USE OF FORCE IS A

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:27.460
VIOLATION OF ITS CHARTER OF
INTERNATIONAL LAW.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:32.565
THE U.S., CANADA AND OTHER
ALLIED FORCES WILL CONTINUE TO

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:37.470
FIGHT THE AGGRESSION OF RUSSIA.
WITH NEW SECURITY ASSISTANCE

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:41.274
THAT WE HAVE ANNOUNCED THIS
WEEK, THE UNITED STATES HAS

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:47.280
GIVEN $16.9 BILLION ASSISTANCE
TO UKRAINE GOING BACK TO JANUARY

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.948
2021.
IN THE MEETING THE FOREIGN

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:54.120
MINISTER AND THE UNITED STATES
HAVE CONTINUED TO SUPPORT WAYS

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:59.091
TO SUPPORT UKRAINE IN THE
DIFFICULT WINTER AHEAD, THE

00:05:59.091 --> 00:06:01.727
INDEPENDENT SOVEREIGN FOR
UKRAINE IS STEADFAST.

00:06:01.727 --> 00:06:04.330
THE UNITED STATES AND CANADA
WILL CONTINUE TO WORK TOGETHER

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:08.501
AT THE G7 TO HELP THE
POPULATIONS HARDEST HIT BY

00:06:08.501 --> 00:06:13.138
PRESIDENT PUTIN'S WAR OF CHOICE,
INCLUDING GETTING LIFE SAVING

00:06:13.138 --> 00:06:15.775
AID TO PEOPLE AFFECTED BY THE
AID TO PEOPLE AFFECTED BY THE

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:19.045
UNPRECEDENTED GLOBAL FOOD CRISIS
AND MAKE IT CRYSTAL CLEAR THAT

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:22.648
WE AND THE NATO ALLIES ARE
PREPARED TO PROTECT EVERY INCH

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:24.150
OF NATO TERRITORY

